{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game: integrates idle combat, monster cultivation, and resource collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core gameplay system:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divided into 4 areas, weapons, clothes, gems, head-grabbing helmets, and accessories are dropped by passing levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can assign monsters to cooperate in combat</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can arrange monsters to do work. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining in the mine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting herbs in the herb garden</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logging in the forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refining tools in the furnace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refining elixirs in the furnace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction team builds buildings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing the bonus of buildings to improve skills</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tower defense battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can assign up to 12 units to defend in the tower defense style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can upgrade the base, including attack power, life, defense, etc. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Monster recruitment </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon monsters of different qualities, each monster has its own unique attribute growth and skills </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill store </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely learn skills and match skills </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment system </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random attribute equipment system, you can inlay gems </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ group: 1039293262 </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u83b7\u5f9710\u4e2a\u5ba0\u7269","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a